==Event Information==
The Battle Cats has soared to a cool '''75 MILLION''' downloads worldwide, and it's time to celebrate!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On from October 17th (11:00am) until October 31st, 2022 (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Treasure Festivals Everyday!'''}}<br>
During this event, get increased Treasure Drop Rates in Story Mode chapters for a special {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Treasure Festival'''}}, all day every day!<br>
On {{Color|#339966|'''even days (10/18, 10/20, 10/22, 10/24, 10/26, 10/28, 10/30)'''}} visit {{Color|#339966|Empire of Cats}}, and on {{Color|#00FFFF|'''odd days (10/17, 10/19, 10/21, 10/23, 10/25, 10/27, 10/29, 10/31'''}} head to {{Color|#00FFFF|'''Into the Future'''}} to take advantage of this special event! Plus, don't miss the Treasure Festival for {{Color|#0000FF|'''Cats of the Cosmos'''}} on {{Color|#0000FF|'''10/19, 10/22, 10/25, 10/28, 10/31'''}}!

※Please note: Treasure Festivals for Empire of Cats and Into the Future will appear only once Empire of Cats Ch. 1 has been cleared. The Treasure Festival for Cats of the Cosmos will appear once Into the Future Ch. 1 has been cleared.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Cat Food presents every day!'''}}<br>
Visit the Battle Cats app to collect a reward of 20 Cat Food each day of the campaign!<br>
Don't miss a day for maximum Cat Food profit!

